Error [jet.ApplicationAuthorityDenied]: FS.Write was denied
 Why: This program writes files, and this REPL session denies that. An explicit `--deny` policy overrides every prompt and allowance.
 Fix: Approve this exact operation interactively, or restart with `jet repl --allow=FS.Write`
